</th></tr>
<tr>
<td>Arcade Racer</td>
<td>Vertical Shooter</td>
<td>Lightgun
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="/Datei:Arcade_Outrun2upright.jpg" class="image"><img alt="Arcade Outrun2upright.jpg" src="/images/thumb/6/61/Arcade_Outrun2upright.jpg/200px-Arcade_Outrun2upright.jpg" width="200" height="267" srcset="/images/thumb/6/61/Arcade_Outrun2upright.jpg/300px-Arcade_Outrun2upright.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/61/Arcade_Outrun2upright.jpg/400px-Arcade_Outrun2upright.jpg 2x" /></a></td>
